    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as an enemy unit picks a **MEGANOBZ/NOBZ** unit of yours as a target, on that unit.\n\nEach time 1 of its models is **destroyed** while your unit has yet to be **selected to fight** in this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 while the unit is **riled up**. If the result is 4+, the model stays on the battlefield until the phase ends or your unit has fought, whichever is first; then remove it.",
